> **Where it lives:** `components/competitions/arena/mobile/`. Below `md`, `app/(root)/competitions/page-content.tsx` renders `MobileCompetitionsArena`. Desktop (`CompetitionsArena`, behind `hidden md:block`) is unchanged.

